_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 20
---
order: 20
---
short_label: VII.20
---
statement: The least numbers of those which have the same ratio with them measure those which have the same ratio with them the same number of times; the greater the greater; and the less the less.
---
proof:

Let *CD* and *EF* be the least numbers of those which have the same ratio with *A* and *B.*

I say that *CD* measures *A* the same number of times that *EF* measures *B.*

<figure class="diagram">
